{"name":"Rosemary","hex":"#405e5c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Rosemary","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from Latin."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Rosemary"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rosemary","blocks":[{"text":"Salvia rosmarinus, synonym Rosmarinus officinalis, commonly known as rosemary, is a shrub with fragrant, evergreen, needle-like leaves and purple or sometimes white, pink, or blue flowers. It is a member of the mint family, Lamiaceae. The species is native to the Mediterranean region. It has numerous cultivars, and its leaves are commonly used as a flavoring."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Rosemary_in_bloom.JPG/330px-Rosemary_in_bloom.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosemary","wikidata":"Q102240169"},{"title":"Rosemary (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Holly Letkeman, better known by the ring name Rosemary, is a Canadian professional wrestler. She is signed to Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA), where she is a member of DemonXBunny, alongside Allie and Kiera Hogan. It is Rosemary's record-setting fifth individual reign. She is also a former one-time Impact Wrestling Knockouts Champion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Rosemary%2C_2018_01_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Rosemary%2C_2018_01_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosemary_(wrestler)","wikidata":"Q3888093"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/RosemarySprig.jpg/500px-RosemarySprig.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/RosemarySprig.jpg/1280px-RosemarySprig.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://th